{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>22歲美國女模Sophie Rain雖然行性感路線，但向來自稱虔誠基督徒與純情處女。她於社交網站亦有以斯斯文文形象示人的寫真，其中她在床上戴住眼鏡，穿上白色內衣，留言表示想被抱抱：「有冇可以攬攬嘅好朋友？唔該呀。」又加上眼濕濕扮可愛表情符號，果然釣到大批粉絲留言自告奮勇！</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.751803+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-18T14:01:19+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T16:33:54.133104+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-18T14:22:59.478943+00:00","content_hash":"4221dfb44024c41eae7b64450bfba50dab949391d39052b3b49695438b29e3ac","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-18T14:29:59.751803+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}